# .github/CODEOWNERS.example
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @ORG/maintainers with your team handle.
#
# Plan note (Verified Fact F13):
# - On PUBLIC repositories (Free or Team) and PRIVATE repositories on GitHub TEAM ($4/user/mo),
#   GitHub enforces CODEOWNERS via branch rulesets / protected branches.
# - On PRIVATE repositories on GitHub FREE, GitHub does not enforce CODEOWNERS natively;
#   therefore .github/workflows/validate-knowledge.yml ALSO enforces frontmatter schema,
#   `locked: true` protection, and human-only `last_verified` on every PR and push.

# Second Brain structure, schema, and templates
/_meta/                         @ORG/maintainers
/_templates/                    @ORG/maintainers

# Locked engineering standards & Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)
/standards/                     @ORG/maintainers
/decisions/                     @ORG/maintainers
/docs/decisions/                @ORG/maintainers

# Project v2 single-source-of-truth config, scripts, and workflows
/project/                       @ORG/maintainers
/scripts/                       @ORG/maintainers
/.github/                       @ORG/maintainers
